repository-code: "https://github.com/tommycarstensen/phase3-failure-decomposition"
abstract: "Code, labels, data and manuscript of the preprint. The paper classifies why phase-3 trials fail, using only ClinicalTrials.gov and linked PubMed abstracts, and asks where a registry-only answer is misleading. Every number in the manuscript and the supplement is written by a script in this repository; bash reproduce.sh regenerates them from the archived retrievals (9 July 2026 and 20 August 2026) and bash build_pdf.sh builds the two PDFs."
keywords:
  - clinical trials
  - ClinicalTrials.gov
  - phase 3
  - trial failure
  - drug development
  - meta-research
  - trial registries
  - large language models
